      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Fisher (1918) showed that once the genotypic values have been partitioned in the above manner, it is a relatively simple step to partition the sources of genetic variation at a locus. Recalling the relationship $ G = \\widehat{G} + \\delta $, the total genetic variance may be written as",
