      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "4619d150b459f7e5d35a98f51880facbd8a8b0190a65441cac049261c3f30d33"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "All of the information necessary to compute these two components of genetic variance for a diallelic locus is contained in Table 4.1, and leads to",
