    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Both components of variance depend upon the gene frequencies, the dominance coefficient k, and the homozygous effect a (Figure 4.8). In the case of purely additive allelic effects (k = 0), the additive genetic variance reaches a maximum",
